---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <article class="px-4 py-8 pb-16 max-w-lg mx-auto space-y-8">
    <header class="space-y-2">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-on-surface">Privacy Notice</h1>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted">
        How OurLens handles images and information when you scan your home.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-on-surface-muted/80">
        Version 1.0 · Last updated 20 October 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Who we are</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        OurLens is provided by Corvidae Jones Limited, trading as OurLives and
        OurLens, registered in England and Wales (company number 15091738).
        We are the controller of the personal data described here.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        Contact: <a class="underline" href="mailto:info@ourlivesapp.com">info@ourlivesapp.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">What we process</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        <li>
          Images of the room you scan: about ten seconds of frames, captured at
          roughly one frame per second and reduced in size before sending.
        </li>
        <li>
          The hazard findings produced from those images: hazard name, risk
          level and recommendation.
        </li>
        <li>
          Your invitation code and its remaining scan allowance.
        </li>
        <li>
          Technical information needed to run and secure the service, such as
          IP address, device or connection information, timestamps and error
          records.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        We do not ask for your name, email address, postal address, telephone
        number, payment details or precise location, and you do not create an
        account.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Why we process it</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        <li>
          To analyse the images and produce hazard findings. The lawful basis is
          your consent.
        </li>
        <li>
          To administer invitation codes, scan allowances and licence usage, and
          to prevent abuse, control cost and diagnose faults. The lawful basis is
          our legitimate interests.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        Images of a home can reveal health, disability, medication, religious
        items or other sensitive information. We rely on your explicit consent
        for that processing. You give it before the camera opens. You can
        withdraw it at any time by contacting us or by not using the service;
        withdrawal stops future scans but does not delete findings already held
        on your device.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        Do not include other people or personal documents in the frame. You
        cannot consent on their behalf.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Who receives it</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        Images are sent through an AI routing service to AI providers that
        analyse the images and convert the results into a structured list. Those
        AI providers are in the United States. The service that runs OurLens is
        hosted in the European Union.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        We do not sell your data, use it for advertising, or allow it to be used
        to train AI models.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        Some processing takes place outside the UK. We are putting the required
        UK-approved transfer safeguards in place and will provide details on
        request.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">How long we keep it</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        <li>
          Images are not stored by OurLens after processing. Temporary files on
          our server are removed automatically; we are reducing the maximum
          retention to 24 hours.
        </li>
        <li>
          AI providers keep inputs and outputs for up to 30 days by default. We
          are requesting zero-retention arrangements.
        </li>
        <li>
          The ten most recent findings are kept on your device for up to 30
          days. You can clear them at any time from the report screen.
        </li>
        <li>
          We are setting a 30-day limit for host and proxy logs, without request
          bodies.
        </li>
        <li>
          Invitation code records are kept for the life of the licence. They
          contain no images or findings.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Your rights</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        You have the right to access, correct, delete, restrict or object to the
        processing of your personal data, and to withdraw consent. Because there
        is no account, we identify a scan by the invitation code and the
        approximate date you used it.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        Email <a class="underline" href="mailto:info@ourlivesapp.com">info@ourlivesapp.com</a>.
        We respond within one month, extendable by two months for complex
        requests. You can also complain to the Information Commissioner's Office
        at <a class="underline" href="https://ico.org.uk" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">ico.org.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Age</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        OurLens is for people aged 18 or over.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-2">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-on-surface">Changes</h2>
      <p class="text-base text-on-surface-muted leading-relaxed">
        We update this notice when the processing changes. The version and date
        at the top show the current version.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
